」など指定いただけたら大丈夫です。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1bExzFP-Nr1fs8duq_LTuRF3ZI4rd4AJq?usp=sharing\n\n以上よろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ura1134/works/35", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/58eae6a3/uploads/origins/8568dc48-f611-459a-bea5-8bfb882403c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=463dd4cb8f911ac4e92f985ea61f1ed4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/58eae6a3/uploads/origins/8568dc48-f611-459a-bea5-8bfb882403c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=463dd4cb8f911ac4e92f985ea61f1ed4, https://si.imgix.net/58eae6a3/uploads/origins/8568dc48-f611-459a-bea5-8bfb882403c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=85ccc3809c934e2d84e772c7a53d6fda 2x, https://si.imgix.net/58eae6a3/uploads/origins/8568dc48-f611-459a-bea5-8bfb882403c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b2bad3f6dc1210f847c9f2268b5fb00 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "月見様 こんばんは🌙*ﾟ\n\nいつも可愛いイラストと、れいるなちゃん拝見しております‎🤍\n\n今回私の創作キャラ（女の子）の衣装デザインをして頂きたくご連絡させて頂きました！\n\nイメカラやモチーフ\n♥赤、黒、白\n♥うさぎ\n♥リボン\n（系統はお任せします🫶🏻💗 ̖́-‬）\n\nここまで読んで下さりありがとうございます、\nご検討の程よろしくお願いします🙏\n\nhttps://prmi0.carrd.co/", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ura1134/works/34", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e5f69d05/uploads/origins/aed48234-6309-4d0a-b669-891cdc3bb140?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c233f1e1e1ec7c8848ea1e67651ac4df", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e5f69d05/uploads/origins/aed48234-6309-4d0a-b669-891cdc3bb140?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c233f1e1e1ec7c8848ea1e67651ac4df, https://si.imgix.net/e5f69d05/uploads/origins/aed48234-6309-4d0a-b669-891cdc3bb140?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8f31a5554dd8c2c667f5ec8023aaf094 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e5f69d05/uploads/ori